MintCurveConvexPosition::claimRewards()
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when the Convex reward pool getReward returns false
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionClaimingRewardsFailed
    ├── it should claim rewards from the configured Convex reward pool
    ├── given the position holds Convex rewards
    │   ├── it should always include configured CRV and CVX
    │   ├── it should discover direct and Convex stash-wrapped extra rewards dynamically
    │   ├── it should deduplicate repeated reward-token addresses
    │   ├── it should not treat an arbitrary ERC20 token() getter as a stash wrapper
    │   ├── it should transfer all Convex rewards held by the position to owner
    │   └── it should emit RewardClaimed for each nonzero transfer
    ├── given optional Convex extra-reward metadata is malformed
    │   ├── it should retain CRV and CVX when extraRewardsLength reverts
    │   ├── it should skip a malformed extra reward pool address
    │   └── it should skip an extra pool whose rewardToken query reverts
    ├── given the position holds no rewards
    │   └── it should return zero amounts without emitting RewardClaimed
    └── given caller is an authorized spender
        └── it should transfer the rewards to the owner
